/-
# L5Reg.Reg70 : the lines clause for every class of the local table of rep #70 (generated by l5reg `genchunk`, 4 parts of at most 100 classes)

Assembles `RegP70_<k>`.  Same statement as the unchunked `Reg<c>`.
No `sorry`, no `native_decide`, no new axiom.  Not registered in any aggregator.
-/
import LRSpectrumFull.L5Reg.Equiv
import LRSpectrumFull.L5S4.GD3O70T
import LRSpectrumFull.L5S4.LinRQSC53
import LRSpectrumFull.L5S4.LinRQSC54
import LRSpectrumFull.L5S4.LinRQSC55
import LRSpectrumFull.L5S4.LinRQSC56
